{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "L2XEHZG2FAGAECIZIZGDRGUKF7U54CYU",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041133006",
    "title": "第6章 情熱から辿るパーソナリティ",
    "enTitle": "Chapter 6: Tracing Personality Through Passion",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あ……そこのテナント、改装中みたいですね。",
            "enText": "Ah… looks like that space over there is being renovated.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 133,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "今度は何のお店が入るんだろうね？",
                    "enText": "<size=39>I wonder what kind of shop will move in next?</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 152,
                    "pathId": -6337382802264121020
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3272041646551768193,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "そうですね……。個人的には、レースカフェだと嬉しいです。\n大画面で生中継を観たり、他のお客さんの予想を聞いたりとか……。",
            "enText": "Yeah… Personally, I'd love it if it were a racing café. Watching live races on a big screen, hearing other customers' predictions and all…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 341,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 281,
                    "pathId": 7740146957184787791
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3815803967861669471
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7920098026297540267,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あっ……アウトドアショップもいいですね。\n双眼鏡や防寒具など、観戦に便利な道具が揃えられますので……。",
            "enText": "Oh… an outdoor shop would be nice too. They'd have binoculars, winter gear, and all kinds of things useful for spectating…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 293,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 320,
                    "pathId": -8115350397254987397
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -5854689979418731947
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4109095608879818796,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "休日。買い物中のクロノジェネシスに出会ったので、\n付き添わせてもらうことにした。",
            "enText": "On my day off. I ran into Chrono Genesis while she was shopping,\nso I decided to tag along.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 311,
                    "pathId": -3554614551928592474
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7201910538258968613,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女の、レース史に向ける激しい情熱。\nそれを知る機会があるたび、同じ思いにとらわれる。",
            "enText": "Her intense passion for racing history. Every time I get a glimpse of it, I am struck by the same thought.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（俺もあの情熱に追いつきたい……！）",
                    "enText": "<size=40>(I want to catch up to that passion too…!)</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（私もあの情熱に追いつきたい……！）",
                    "enText": "<size=40>(I want to catch up to that passion too…!)</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 5606199683168678858
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 248,
                    "pathId": 112792681474826543
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 234,
                    "pathId": 7436706597790791237
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1377900933510559446,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "連写が秒間15コマで、電子シャッターなら30コマ……。\nうーん……いいなぁ……。でも、やっぱり値段が……。",
            "enText": "15 frames per second in burst mode, and 30 with an electronic shutter… Hmm… it's really nice… but yeah, the price…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 377,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "レース撮影用の新しいカメラ？",
                    "enText": "A new camera for shooting races?",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 113,
                    "pathId": -5419140399699161330
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 88,
                    "pathId": 6373592526757958394
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -6095268982159980512
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 5004134118382967585
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1544185910061361593,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あ、はい……。今のカメラに少し物足りなさを感じまして。\n私のお小遣いだと、買えるものは限られますが……。",
            "enText": "Ah, yes… I've been feeling like my current camera is a bit lacking. Though with my allowance, there's only so much I can afford…",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 325,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 100,
                    "pathId": -5923202164374667833
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 172,
                    "pathId": -1070558174746160423
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2919124759265131253,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カメラショップの店員",
            "enName": "Camera Shop Clerk",
            "jpText": "お客様、何かお探しでしょうか？　よろしければ\nご予算内でお望みの性能に近づくようご提案いたしますよ。",
            "enText": "Are you looking for something? If you'd like, I can recommend something close to what you're after within your budget.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 243,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 283,
                    "pathId": 6701471673455852580
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 222,
                    "pathId": -4324597033698427052
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4862696989342432921,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "ほ、本当ですか？　ありがとうございます！\nそれでしたら――……。",
            "enText": "R-Really? Thank you so much!\nIn that case—…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 197,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 260,
                    "pathId": -6449565996535486018
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 4663566746894362050
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2565617342136352415,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カメラショップの店員",
            "enName": "Camera Shop Clerk",
            "jpText": "お持ちの機材でしたら、レンズの追加でも対応できそうですね。\nこちらの焦点距離は70から300mm。動体への追随性も抜群ですよ。",
            "enText": "With your current equipment, adding a lens should do the trick. This one has a focal length of 70 to 300mm, and excellent subject tracking.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 331,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 1159941307037763473
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 181,
                    "pathId": 3386686803361049143
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4100867171262620172,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "わあ……！　300mmで事足りるレース場も多いですし。\n東京レース場は広いけど、腕と場所で工夫すればいい感じに……。",
            "enText": "Waah…! There are plenty of racecourses where 300mm is enough. Tokyo Racecourse is pretty big, but with the right skill and positioning, it should work well…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 345,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（な、なるほど……？）",
                    "enText": "(I-I see…?)",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 200,
                    "pathId": 7311891402923053539
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 6705039201741966012
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5304814647721076049,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "独自の機構で手ブレも防げるし、色収差も効果的に補正……。\nそれに中古なら、お小遣いを頑張って貯めれば…………！",
            "enText": "It has a unique stabilization system, and it corrects chromatic aberration really well… And if I get it used, I might be able to afford it if I save up my allowance…!",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 341,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 73,
                    "pathId": 7346303810974001982
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1215042182055186776
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5237296897525268020,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "…………あっ。す、すみません……！\n一人で盛り上がってしまって……。",
            "enText": "………Ah. I-I'm sorry…!\nI got a little carried away……",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 185,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ううん、大丈夫だよ",
                    "enText": "Don't worry about it",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 6489626480390370532
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -4257072053291220731
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2443474485248012015,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "『風と蹄鉄のゲーム理論』……『史実から見る明日の勝ち筋』……。\n……うん。欲しい本、全部、在庫検索に引っかかってる。",
            "enText": "\"Game Theory of Wind and Horseshoes\" … \"Winning Strategies Through Historical Data\" …\n…Yeah. Looks like all the books I want are in stock.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 395,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 200,
                    "pathId": -5628517182797606878
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -1554402176296298437
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1287264210036590557,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "ただ……取ってくるのに時間がかかるかしら。\nこのお店、結構広いし……ジャンルもバラバラだから……。",
            "enText": "Though… it might take a while to get them. This store is pretty big……and the genres are all over the place…",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 340,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "じゃあ、手分けして集めよっか！",
                    "enText": "Then let's split up and grab them!",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 354,
                    "pathId": -6833476636749435181
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 95,
                    "pathId": 917855161601493444
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 366,
                    "pathId": 4454171583725246645
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4533648505255421271,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "えっ……。あ、ありがとうございます。でしたら、\n科学系の本をお願いできますか？　私は歴史系を探しますので……。",
            "enText": "Oh… thank you. In that case, could I ask you to get the science books? I'll look for the history ones……",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 358,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -5482528395660986854
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -7174879314847087585
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 437,
                    "pathId": 1935608811786706560
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1402540341145193524,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "目的の本を見つけた後、集合場所へ。\nだが、クロノジェネシスはなかなか戻らない。",
            "enText": "After finding the books, I headed to the meeting spot. But Chrono Genesis was taking a while to show up.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 95,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（何かあったのかな……？）",
                    "enText": "(Did something happen…?)",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -5099685318769754527
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": -8951768772728440054
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6491725298596567773,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "廃止になったレース場の記録……！？\n古いものだと、100年以上昔のものまで……！",
            "enText": "Records from discontinued racecourses…!?\nSome of these go back over a hundred years…!",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 205,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 245,
                    "pathId": 5454485613341545244
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 284,
                    "pathId": 8931705753389863896
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4551205464177411079,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "すごい、掘り出し物……！　近代レースの発展を知る上で\n当時の情報は欠かせないけれど、これほどの史料は滅多に……！",
            "enText": "Amazing… what a find…! To understand the development of modern racing, information from that time is essential—but materials like these are incredibly rare…!",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 359,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ク～～ロノ？",
                    "enText": "Chrooono～?",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 370,
                    "pathId": 8784926969343808409
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 306,
                    "pathId": 9079015327706919304
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3006360096413230147,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "え……？\n……ああっ、トレーナーさん……！！",
            "enText": "Huh…?\n…Ah, Trainer…!!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 140,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 186,
                    "pathId": -8353789515161821313
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 153,
                    "pathId": -4997014572626814810
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 64,
                    "pathId": 2271803908316369422
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7140566165950429868,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "本っ当にごめんなさい……！！\n貴重な史料を見つけて、つい……。",
            "enText": "I'm so, so sorry…!!\nI found something really valuable and just…",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 183,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "全然気にしてないよ",
                    "enText": "Really, I don't mind",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 94,
                    "pathId": -7673816043723163013
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -2027177908698695500
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5459083426863232512,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "で、でも……。",
            "enText": "B-But…",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 65,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 94,
                    "pathId": 5985048009576423683
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6693784087441034463,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "すっかり恐縮してしまったクロノジェネシス。\n気を取り直してもらうために、何かいいものはないかと見回し――",
            "enText": "Chrono Genesis looked completely apologetic.\nTrying to cheer her up, I looked around for something—",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そうだ、今からあそこに行かないか？",
                    "enText": "Hey, why don't we go over there?",
                    "nextBlock": 24
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "そうだ、今からあそこに行かない？",
                    "enText": "Hey, why don't we go over there?",
                    "nextBlock": 24
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": 1548002573428004137
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2558537120013083605,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "レースカフェ……。\nこんなところにもあったんですね……。",
            "enText": "A race café…\nI didn't know there was one here…",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 134,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ここなら一緒にレースも楽しめるな！",
                    "enText": "We can enjoy the races together here!",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "ここなら一緒にレースも楽しめるね！",
                    "enText": "We can enjoy the races together here!",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 184,
                    "pathId": 3391093162305203179
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 113,
                    "pathId": 4778083809487407423
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9149722235775395521,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あ……。はいっ、ありがとうございます……っ。",
            "enText": "Ah… yes, thank you very much…",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 132,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 93,
                    "pathId": 3257059804326916812
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 3967012909928349376
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -101614509702947450,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（……やっぱり、気を使わせているわよね……。\nきっと、今日だけじゃなくて……）",
            "enText": "(…I really am making them go out of their way for me, aren't I… And not just today…)",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 227,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 247,
                    "pathId": 7123042304567519496
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 276,
                    "pathId": 5972388183457985353
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6135463923746785750,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（トレーナーさんは優しい人だから……\n私がレースに夢中になってても、笑って許してくださる……）",
            "enText": "(Trainer is a kind person…\nEven when I get completely absorbed in racing, they just smile and accept it…)",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 219,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 8,
                    "pathId": 4173868209566045049
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -3678001413894073591
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 347,
                    "pathId": 852049769328363009
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 261,
                    "pathId": -6419693975229598904
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2385250560583169387,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "（けど……このまま迷惑をかけてたら、\nトレーナーさんだって、いつか……）",
            "enText": "(But… if I keep causing trouble like this,\neven my Trainer might eventually…)",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 203,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 347,
                    "pathId": 2932913968871828980
